@startuml
' Run-time alignment over one cycle, measured from T0 = the ADA detector's first emitted R3 frame.
' Values from Scenario_Player/scenarios/default.yaml (cpm_rate_hz 10, duration_s 10, loop true,
' C at 70.0 m closing 5.0 m/s), ADA_ECU/media/ego-b-occluding-c.mp4 (10.0 s, B ~60 m -> ~10 m),
' R13 (gate_enter 30 m, gate_exit 35 m, CONFIRM_HITS 3) and R14 (RISK_DWELL_MS 300).
' Horizontal axis is run time from T0, in tenths of a second.

title One 10 s cycle from T0 - the normal screen holds until the first R4 at 8.5-8.9 s

concise "Run time from T0 [0.1 s]" as T
concise "C relayed range d_BC (R2 object.distance)" as D
concise "B track state (own_sensor, R13)" as B
concise "C track state (v2x_relayed, R13)" as C
concise "IVI display mode" as W

@0
T is "T0 - detector frame 0, bench cycle start"
D is "70 m"
B is not_tracked
C is not_tracked
W is "HomeView (normal screen)"

@1
T is {hidden}

@60
B is tentative

@66
B is tracked

@80
D is "30 m - gate_enter crossed"
C is tentative

@83
C is tracked

@87
W is "WarningView (risk medium)"

@100
T is "T0 + 10.0 s - clip and bench wrap together"
D is "70 m"
B is not_tracked
C is not_tracked

highlight 0 to 83 #LightGreen : B admitted at 6.6 s - 1.7 s ahead of C
highlight 85 to 100 #Gold : warning window - first R4 at 8.5-8.9 s, and the view holds across the wrap

@enduml
